<td id="A2.T3.8.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A2.T3.8.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">26.0 (<math id="A2.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\!-5.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0.072em">−</mo><mn>5.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\!-5.5</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.8.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A2.T3.8.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">28.2 (<math id="A2.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\!-3.3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0.072em">−</mo><mn>3.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\!-3.3</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T3.8.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T3.8.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb"><span id="A2.T3.8.3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qwen-3</span></th>
<td id="A2.T3.8.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="A2.T3.8.3.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">38.6</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.8.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="A2.T3.8.3.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">35.7 (<math id="A2.T3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\!-2.9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0.072em">−</mo><mn>2.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\!-2.9</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.8.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="A2.T3.8.3.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">37.3 (<math id="A2.T3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\!-1.3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0.072em">−</mo><mn>1.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\!-1.3</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Effect of resuming from large-scale pre-training on <span id="A2.T4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ProsQA</span>. Accuracy (%); <math id="A2.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> is the change vs. Hyp. 2 (scratch).</figcaption>
<table id="A2.T4.8" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
